Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.09,0:00:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.77,0:01:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm almost to Pegasus' castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.13,0:01:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to be on my guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.75,0:01:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,His goons are everywhere, but\Nthey won't stop me. Nothing will.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.57,0:01:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba's life's at stake, and nothing's\Nmore important than my little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.81,0:01:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,After our parents died, I promised I'd\Nalways take care of him, and I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.67,0:01:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He's always looked up to me,\Nand I won't disappoint him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.67,0:01:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Not now, not ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.35,0:01:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's the famous Seto Kaiba Searching\Nfor your little brother, no doubt
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.33,0:01:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You're coming with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.75,0:01:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, you're coming with me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.99,0:01:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna help me find\NMokuba wherever Pegasus has.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.99,0:01:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,him And you're gonna start by\Ngetting me into that castle
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.43,0:02:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,With our trap, you stopped our\Nattack. Just as you did, Pledge,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.85,0:02:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,but with our scores Ahead of\Nyours, we still have the edge
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.71,0:02:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We're just getting started
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.43,0:02:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.34,0:02:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,so far the only monster\NI got in the field is
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.91,0:02:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,my Axe Raider I need to\Nbolster our attack force
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.73,0:02:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, my Flame Swordsman\Nwill heat things up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.99,0:02:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I put it in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.99,0:02:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Its power level is five, but\NI'll move only four spaces.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.77,0:02:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll also move Axe Raider forward four
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.03,0:02:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,spaces to join him and\Nconsolidate our forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.33,0:02:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already used up Kunai\Nwith Chain's Trap Effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.49,0:02:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,but it still works as a\Nregular accessory card,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.83,0:02:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,raising Axe Raider's\Nattack power by 500 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.67,0:02:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see you take that\Non you twisted twins
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.13,0:03:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if your\Nforces are one or many. For soon
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.09,0:03:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,There won't be any Labyrinth\Ntank. Advance seven more spaces.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.81,0:03:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Labyrinth tank wields futuristic\Nweaponry Your archaic soldiers
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.49,0:03:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,don't stand a chance And soon\Nthey will be within striking
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.29,0:03:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,range And somewhere in the\Nlabyrinth Lurks another trap for
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.77,0:03:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,your unwary warriors Do you\Nreally think you stand a chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.87,0:03:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you two ever stop\Nyacking? You're up, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.73,0:03:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I play Dark Magician in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.75,0:03:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I move him forward five spaces\Nto defend our other warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.37,0:03:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.28,0:03:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice move, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.29,0:03:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the gang's all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.71,0:03:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They're a team, just like you and me, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.35,0:03:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.26,0:03:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There's strength in numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.47,0:03:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Together, they stand a much better\Nchance of conquering this murderous maze.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.71,0:03:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall see about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.61,0:04:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit grinning and spit it out. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.53,0:04:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a magic card, and that's cause\Nfor celebration, brother, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.85,0:04:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now face the wall-warping power of...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.93,0:04:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Magical Labyrinth!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.31,0:04:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.53,0:04:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The maze.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.83,0:04:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.23,0:04:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And that changes the whole game.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.69,0:04:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.85,0:04:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The maze is changing shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.53,0:04:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but what's it all mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.69,0:04:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just great.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.33,0:04:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Our guys are cut off from each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.05,0:04:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the power of the magical labyrinth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.63,0:04:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,To reshape the maze according to our will.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.93,0:04:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That should rattle them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.01,0:04:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Tag teams are only as strong\Nas their weakest link.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.95,0:04:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And the link that's about to break is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.29,0:04:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.20,0:04:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Our strategy's blown.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.23,0:04:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let them rattle you, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.87,0:04:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.78,0:05:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Uke.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.91,0:05:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.31,0:05:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Axe Raider, Flame Swordsman,\Nadvance and regroup.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.95,0:05:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The closer our boys get to the maze exit,\Nthe closer we get to getting out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.25,0:05:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Joey, look out! Too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.07,0:05:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,He activated my trap. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.47,0:05:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And now the landmine\Nspider attacks Axe Raider.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.03,0:05:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Fend him off, Axe Raider.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.65,0:05:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He's too weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.19,0:05:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Jirai Kumo reduces Axe Raider's\Nattack power to its original 1700.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.43,0:05:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That means...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.65,0:05:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Axe Raider is vanquished.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.29,0:05:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And you lose 400 life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.55,0:05:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,400 points? You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.53,0:05:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey just walked right into that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.19,0:05:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Good trap, my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.89,0:05:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.93,0:05:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Labyrinth tank, advance seven more.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.13,0:05:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And then I'll lay one more card.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.41,0:05:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,In defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.63,0:06:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you going to tell us what it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.45,0:06:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You have enough to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.57,0:06:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,My labyrinth tank is now within striking\Ndistance of your flame swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.47,0:06:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all over for him in the next turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.77,0:06:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you can worry about what\Nother surprises I have in store.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.63,0:06:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This doesn't look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.27,0:06:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.61,0:06:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a good thing Yugi's up next.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.59,0:06:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll counterattack.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.11,0:06:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I play the Magic Card Mystic Box in\Ncombination with the Dark Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.49,0:06:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I seal my Dark Magician\Nwithin the first Mystic Box.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.47,0:06:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,as swords rain from the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.77,0:06:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.27,0:06:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The duelist's gone mad,\Nsacrificing his own monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.87,0:06:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, look. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.09,0:07:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Another box materializing\Naround my dear eye, Kubo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.03,0:07:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.55,0:07:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,My spider is cured.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.59,0:07:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,and his Dark Magician is unharmed!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.53,0:07:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.45,0:07:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,My Dark Magician magically switched\Nhis position with that of your monster,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.79,0:07:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,trapping him in the first Mystic\NBox and ending my magic act.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.23,0:07:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.15,0:07:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see Q-Ball top that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.05,0:07:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.96,0:07:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And now for his tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.89,0:07:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Magician, Dark Magic Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.67,0:07:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see what that does\Nto your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.41,0:07:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Together, Joey and I will overcome any\Nobstacles that you two put in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.61,0:07:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You have security clearance. Open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.31,0:07:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think we should ring the bell?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.37,0:08:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you should shut your\Nmouth and open the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.11,0:08:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Open it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.69,0:08:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You do know no one takes\NPegasus by surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.09,0:08:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He probably already knows\Nyou're here. Somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.11,0:08:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.15,0:08:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.29,0:08:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Dumbo Duo, now we're\Ngonna clean your clocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.97,0:08:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Of yourself, you think too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.99,0:08:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Show them, Brother, our lucky touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.69,0:08:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like it when that goon grins.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.75,0:08:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanga of Thunder is one of three gods\Nthat control thunder, wind, and water.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.17,0:08:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The remaining two cards are Sui-Gene,\NGod of Water, and Kazi-Gene, God of Wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.49,0:08:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If our luck holds two more\Nturns and we acquire them all,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.95,0:08:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,they can be combined to\Ncreate the Gate Guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.71,0:08:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit your mumbling, no hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.67,0:09:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hurry up and move.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.39,0:09:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so hasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.67,0:09:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I will lay this card face\Ndown, ending my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.13,0:09:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Intriguing, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.04,0:09:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What could be in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.37,0:09:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but we'll bust it open\Nand find out when our guys get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.67,0:09:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Flame swordsman, advance five more\Nspaces toward the end of the maze.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.07,0:09:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost there, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.19,0:09:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let them escape\Nthe maze until we've
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.83,0:09:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,assembled all the pieces of the Guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.83,0:09:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we'll test my luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.81,0:09:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Sui-Gi, the Water God.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.75,0:09:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I've doubled our delights.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.41,0:09:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Another Chinese box.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.59,0:09:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What could they be?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.17,0:09:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a bad feeling about those boxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.43,0:09:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I sense something ancient and evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.83,0:10:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like I can feel a powerful,\Ndangerous energy pulsating inside them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.65,0:10:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We cannot summon the Gatekeeper yet, but\Nwe can still slow our enemies' advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.73,0:10:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I now play my hidden card.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.21,0:10:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Dungeon Wurf, return to the\Nsurface now in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.25,0:10:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And I will strengthen\Nit with Invigoration,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.89,0:10:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,which raises its attack\Npower by 400 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.81,0:10:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that beast? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.77,0:10:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a burrower and it's coming for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.27,0:10:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.25,0:10:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's that thing hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.41,0:10:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.67,0:10:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.58,0:10:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,My Celtic Guardian!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.49,0:10:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch your life points go slithering away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.45,0:10:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.99,0:10:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That creature can pop up any place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.95,0:10:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.86,0:10:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This field gives their\Nmonsters all the advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.25,0:10:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.17,0:10:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No one escapes the labyrinth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.41,0:10:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's up to you, Yug.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.71,0:10:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna have to pull\Na winner out of your hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.61,0:10:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.93,0:11:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I play magical hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.83,0:11:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hats, materialize!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.61,0:11:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,As for our warriors, now you see them...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.09,0:11:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.95,0:11:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.15,0:11:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,They're multiplying,\Nhiding all their monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.61,0:11:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Yug.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.52,0:11:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That should sure confuse\Nthat slimy worm of theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.87,0:11:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And the dungeon worm's\Nattack power is only 2,200,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.99,0:11:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,while the Dark Magician's is 2,500.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.51,0:11:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,So if the worm chooses the wrong\Nhat and uncovers the Dark Magician,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.21,0:11:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,he'll only destroy himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.05,0:11:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And that guarantees your\Nswordsman's safety as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.47,0:11:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Because with the Dark Magician lying in\Nwait, the worm dare not strike any hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.51,0:11:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Your little plan is not as\Nfoolproof as you think, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.03,0:11:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Monster Tamer, appear now in attack mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.53,0:11:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.44,0:11:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The monster tamer?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.37,0:11:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha! Normally,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.47,0:11:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't control the dungeon worm or any
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.37,0:11:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,other monster my brother\Nplaced on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.67,0:12:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But by using this monster tamer,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.95,0:12:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I can add 600 points to the\Ndungeon worm's attack power and
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.13,0:12:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,also make the worm follow my\Ntamer's instructions during my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.49,0:12:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, 2,800.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.67,0:12:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That raises the dungeon worm's attack\Npower higher than the dark magicians.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.97,0:12:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Monster Tamer,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.91,0:12:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,command my brother's dungeon worm\Nto destroy one of the magic hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.31,0:12:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,With their dungeon worm powered\Nup by the Monster Tamer,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.47,0:12:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,this all comes down to luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.21,0:12:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Empty hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.83,0:12:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.73,0:12:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Luck was with us this time, but the\Ndungeon worm will attack again next turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.21,0:12:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, with only one empty hat\Nremaining, the odds will be against us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.83,0:12:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What can we do? Don't sweat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.21,0:12:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I got it all figured out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.91,0:12:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You just sit back and watch\Nme and the flame swordsman go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.49,0:12:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.99,0:12:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Joey nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.35,0:12:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,His swordsman was safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.31,0:13:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.22,0:13:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This time I know what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.61,0:13:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I played a magic card. Salamandra!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.49,0:13:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.43,0:13:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You ought to be scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.57,0:13:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It juices up any fire-based blade\Nand raises its attack point 700.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.75,0:13:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Swordsman, Salamander Flametstrike.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.91,0:13:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it going? Good show.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.39,0:13:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only does Salamander increase\Nthe swordsman's attack strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.85,0:13:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,but because of the\Nworm's weakness to fire,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.07,0:13:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,it negates the bonus points the\Nworm got from the monster tamer,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.63,0:13:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,returning its attack power to 2200.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.33,0:13:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Less than my supercharged\Nswordsman, the worm turns.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.63,0:13:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Or should I say burns?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.81,0:13:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Top that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.85,0:13:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, great move.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.01,0:13:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Good going.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.92,0:13:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.31,0:13:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You must draw the card we need! Indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.95,0:13:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.86,0:13:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The third piece!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.85,0:13:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This will seal their fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.65,0:13:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The third piece!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.91,0:13:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,With which we'll now create!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.51,0:13:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,A monster who will...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.35,0:13:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Annihilate!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.83,0:14:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Against...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.74,0:14:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The Trinity!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.65,0:14:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,They can't defend!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.65,0:14:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,All their life points we will rend!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.71,0:14:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Summon Kazajin, God of Wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.45,0:14:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.97,0:14:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, the Trinity.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.01,0:14:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's in the class of Exodia.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.13,0:14:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.31,0:14:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Elements of thunder, water and wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.71,0:14:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Sui-Chi-Sanga-Kazaji begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.19,0:14:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Meld your powers in eternal life.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.17,0:14:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Show these fools your unstoppable might.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.75,0:14:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.21,0:14:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.47,0:14:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He is paid beyond description.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.57,0:14:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll mark the graves\Nwith your inscription.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.13,0:14:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Gate Guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.21,0:14:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't possibly win!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.69,0:14:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It has the strength of three monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.05,0:14:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, each three guys in one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.21,0:15:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We're never getting out of this maze.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.53,0:15:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what do they do? I\Ndon't know. This looks bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.11,0:15:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so downbeat, Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.27,0:15:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,If they don't beat them, we'll\Nnever get out of the labyrinth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.09,0:15:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan, thanks for cheering me up, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.59,0:15:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So, think you can beat us\Nwith your big multiple guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.39,0:15:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we're not giving up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.63,0:15:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go. Bring it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.69,0:15:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha, ha, ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.07,0:15:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.51,0:15:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No one's ever gotten\Npast the Gate Guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.81,0:15:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,He is composed of three parts, each\Ncontrolling an elemental force.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.65,0:15:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never get past his combined power.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.93,0:15:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You will wander the labyrinth,\Nlost for all eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.51,0:15:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Me and Yu-Gi will take\Non anything that you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.27,0:15:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey's right. We're a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.19,0:15:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never beat our combined power.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.61,0:15:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Take your turn. Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.81,0:15:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to take me to Mokuba,\Nnot on a tour. It's endless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.23,0:15:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,These tunnels are honeycombed\Nthroughout the entire island.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.79,0:15:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Without me to guide you, you could\Nget lost down here for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.25,0:15:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get any ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.31,0:15:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Slim, I'm much bigger\Nand much stronger than you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.45,0:16:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You only got the jump on me because\Nyou snuck up and took me by surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.27,0:16:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What's to stop me from spinning\Naround right now and knocking your...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.01,0:16:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Try it and I'll drop you where you stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.45,0:16:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.36,0:16:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,when you put it that way,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.31,0:16:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,nothing would please me more than to\Nreunite you with your brother, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.51,0:16:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You promised, Seto.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.39,0:16:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You promised you'd never\Nlet anyone separate us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.59,0:16:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Even at the orphanage, when all the\Nother boys were being adopted one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.55,0:16:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Some parents wanted you, said you were a\Ngenius, but you refused to go without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.91,0:16:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.82,0:16:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That could have been you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.43,0:16:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But you said we weren't leaving the\Norphanage until we could both leave together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.39,0:16:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't let them separate\Nus? Never. Don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.17,0:16:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No one will ever keep us apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.31,0:16:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But what about Pegasus?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.39,0:16:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You couldn't stop him from capturing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.03,0:16:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he too much for you to handle?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.65,0:17:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What if he's got you, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.27,0:17:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.25,0:17:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,This is as far as we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.87,0:17:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Mokuba?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.91,0:17:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,In Pegasus's grip, just\Nlike you'll soon be, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.57,0:17:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop playing games.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.63,0:17:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The alarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.21,0:17:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to find your brother before\Nreinforcements arrive, better hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.75,0:17:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Security will be here any moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.31,0:17:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.47,0:17:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to get him out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.11,0:17:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Away from Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.71,0:17:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Kimo has reported in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.79,0:17:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems Seto Kaiba has\Nbeen spotted in the tunnels.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.91,0:17:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Once again, Croquet, you\Nreport what I already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.13,0:17:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg your pardon, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.23,0:17:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You can beg later when you are punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.15,0:17:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto Kaiba's presence on the island\Nwas not part of my original plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.91,0:17:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But perhaps I can turn this to\Nmy advantage and my amusement.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.99,0:17:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuva! Mokuva! Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.39,0:17:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.13,0:18:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your turn, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.99,0:18:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack that big ugly log!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.69,0:18:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing in my deck is powerful\Nenough to attack the Gate Guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.93,0:18:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I can only play these.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.61,0:18:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What a waste of a turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.69,0:18:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You're frightened, for all your\Nmonsters are too weak to attack ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.03,0:18:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Gate Guardian, use your immense power.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.87,0:18:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack Flame Swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.19,0:18:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Eliminate him from the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.85,0:18:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it, bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.01,0:18:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going down in a big way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.19,0:18:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Thunderstroke attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.73,0:18:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Plane Swordsman is about to flame out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.67,0:19:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go, go, go.
